stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Loading: Open disclosure
  Loading --> Ready: Valid board, retain condition
  Loading --> Error: Invalid board or read failure
  Ready --> Ready: Select condition, no read
  Ready --> Loading: Refresh or apply server filters
  Error --> Loading: Retry
  Ready --> Ready: Close and reopen disclosure
  Loading --> Idle: Authorization failure or clear
  Ready --> Idle: Clear session
  Loading --> Disposed: Dispose and ignore pending response
  Idle --> Idle: Ignore retired response
  Disposed --> [*]
